{"kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of spaces semantic tokens to use for button spaces"}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider"]]},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider\/spaces","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"],"tokens":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spaces","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesContract\/documentation\/OUDSThemesContract\/AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}]}],"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetypographycomponenttokensprovider\/spaces"]}],"sections":[],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"metadata":{"title":"spaces","role":"symbol","externalID":"s:16OUDSThemesOrange0B38ThemeTypographyComponentTokensProviderC6spaces0A8Contract016AllSpaceSemanticfG0_pvp","roleHeading":"Instance Property","modules":[{"name":"Theme Orange"}],"fragments":[{"text":"let","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"spaces","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": any ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider","kind":"typeIdentifier"}],"symbolKind":"property"},"references":{"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","title":"OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A class which wraps all "},{"type":"strong","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"component  tokens of typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components like "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSText"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Contains also references to semantic tokens providers so as to be able to use them to define the component tokens."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"This provider should be integrated as a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllTypographyComponentTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation inside "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to provide"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"all tokens to the users. It helps users to override some of the tokens and assign them to an "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" implementation to use."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"Custom themes can use subclass of "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" and apply the provider they need."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"It implements also the protocol "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"TypographyComponentTokens"},{"type":"text","text":" so as to expose the component tokens for "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" through any "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":"."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"emphasis","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Typography"}]},{"type":"text","text":" components tokens are defined with semantic tokens of spaces (from "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"},{"type":"text","text":")."}],"kind":"symbol","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"class","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetypographycomponenttokensprovider","type":"topic","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider","kind":"identifier"}]},"ic_theme_orange.png":{"type":"image","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png","alt":null,"variants":[{"traits":["1x","light"],"url":"\/images\/OUDSThemesOrange\/ic_theme_orange.png"}]},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider/spaces":{"title":"spaces","role":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange\/orangethemetypographycomponenttokensprovider\/spaces","identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange\/OrangeThemeTypographyComponentTokensProvider\/spaces","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"spaces"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:18OUDSThemesContract30AllSpaceSemanticTokensProviderP","text":"AllSpaceSemanticTokensProvider"}],"type":"topic","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Provider of spaces semantic tokens to use for button spaces"}],"kind":"symbol"},"doc://OUDSThemesOrange/documentation/OUDSThemesOrange":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OUDSThemesOrange\/documentation\/OUDSThemesOrange","title":"Theme Orange","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The Orange theme overrides some tokens from the basic "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"OUDSTheme"},{"type":"text","text":" and should be seen as the default theme for the OUDS library with the Orange brand colors for example."}],"images":[{"type":"icon","identifier":"ic_theme_orange.png"}],"role":"collection","url":"\/documentation\/oudsthemesorange","type":"topic"},"doc://OUD